  "motion": {
    "frames": 120,
    "note": "Tiny fairy dangling under its huge flower like a parachute/kite (official art, Z-A menu sprite), 120 frames x 30 ms = 3.6 s. Driver: the big flower floats, a slow light bob (broad crest, quick trough) and a tiny drift. The fairy hangs from the flower by the stem and swings as a slow pendulum a beat after the drift (stem bends with a lag growing toward the fairy, the whole sprite counter-shifted so the flower stays nearly put and the fairy does the swinging). On the fairy: the body sways after the stem, arms and the coiled tail trail later, the antennae flutter lightly. The petal tips flex after the bob, late and small (they are wide and long). All periods divide the loop: seamless.",
    "functions": {
      "FY": "HOVER_PX*wave(t + 0.25, SKEW)",
      "hn": "wave(t + 0.25, SKEW)",
      "dr": "sin(2*pi*t)",
      "pa": "SWAY_DEG*sin(2*pi*(t - SWAY_LAG))",
      "FX": "DRIFT_PX*dr(t) + COMP*pa(t)"
    }
  },
